      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance, ensure all text meets a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1, while large text must hit at least 3:1. Always specify sufficient focus states for keyboard navigation and use alt text for all non-decorative images to support screen readers. You can verify these ratios instantly using free tools like WebAIM's Contrast Checker before finalizing your design.",
